# Local development does not load an environment file.
# Run npm run dev from the repository root.
# Worker/D1/R2: backend/wrangler.jsonc, APP_ENV=local, loopback only.
# Auth secret: generated privately in .local/auth.secret (do not copy into Git).
# Verification/reset mail: npm run local:mail; no real email is sent.
# No Supabase, PostgreSQL, hosted Preview or Production credentials belong here.
# See docs/local-development.md and docs/local-production-workflow.md.
